  "body_html": "<h1>not_isFree_iff</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma not_isFree_iff {n : ℕ} (s : DAState n) (i : Fin n) : isFree s i = false ↔ ∃ j : Fin n, s.holding j = some i</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>isFree</li>\n</ul>",
